F1+F2+F3+F4 owner rulings (ratified by dispatcher 2026-04-29):

  F1. `agent_file_authoring.py` + `agent_file_runner.py` STAY
      at `framework/hands-off-lifecycle/hooks/`. Both are
      runtime infrastructure imported unconditionally by
      `first_run_helper.py` for ALL workspaces (not dev-mode-
      only). Master plan §6.5.2 row 6's MOVE list corrected:
      drop these two files from the list.

  F2. Option D hybrid for A1-A4 settings.json registration.
      The five gate-hook SOURCE files (`objective_binding_gate.py`
      + `tdd_guard.py` + `bash_guard.py` + `agent_guard.py` +
      `dispatch_setup_hook.py`) MOVE to `plugins/dev-sdlc/hooks/`.
      Writer logic at `first_run_helper.py` STAYS; gains a
      `_resolve_gate_script(loam_root, name)` helper that
      probes for plugin-side path first
      (`<loam_root>/plugins/dev-sdlc/hooks/<gate>.py`); falls
      back to canonical-side
      (`<loam_root>/framework/hands-off-lifecycle/hooks/<gate>.py`)
      if plugin tree absent. Mirror of amendment #67's
      `_resolve_corpus_path` probe-and-prefer pattern. ~30 LOC
      for the helper + 5 stanza-builder edits.

  F3. `loam amend` shadow-then-flip mechanic deferred to M6b.1.
